<title>USA: Smith Barney buys option plan administrator.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney buys option plan administrator.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney, a unit of Travelers Group Inc, said Thursday that it acquired Perkins Shareholder Services, which administers stock option plans for corporations.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Smith Barney said Perkins focus on plans for newly-public companies in the Silicon Valley area. Smith Barney administers stock option plans for over 120 public companes and more than 750,000 individuals.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
